The '''Liberation of Tiki Outpost''' is an event at the [[Tiki Outpost]].

==Spawning==
{{Main|Tyrant of the Skies}}
The Liberation of Tiki Outpost is triggered when the [[Tyrant of the Skies]] is spawned. It says <span style="color:red;">'''"Wings of wrath descend upon intruders."'''</span> in the chat box/upper part of their screen. 

===Appearance===
A bright yellow mist will cover the entire [[Tiki Outpost]], similar to the [[Prehistoric Island]]’s fog.

==Trivia==
* The Tiki Outpost will be renamed to '''<Liberation of Tiki Outpost>''' if the player is in the spawn area of the [[Tyrant of the Skies]]. But if they go to a specific area outside the spawn of [[Tyrant of the Skies]] spawn, the [[locations|island]] will be renamed back to '''<Tiki Outpost>'''.
* The Liberation of Tiki Outpost shares the same [[Soundtracks|soundtrack]] as the [[Battle of the Gods]], [[Swan's Room]], and [[Dimensional Shift]] which is called ''Lizard Bandit Clan''.

